    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "一个设计示例，其中向 II 型系统 G(s)=10/s^2 中加入超前校正装置，以实现调节时间 ≤4 s 且阻尼比 ζ≥0.45，由此得到的校正装置为 G_c(s)=K/6 (1+s/2.0)/(1+s/12.0)，其中 K=6，使得 P.O.=34%，T_s=1.3 s，ω_B=8.4 rad/s，且 P.M.=45.6°。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "A design example where a phase-lead compensator is added to a type-two system G(s)=10/s^2 to achieve settling time ≤4 s and damping ratio ζ≥0.45, resulting in a compensator G_c(s)=K/6 (1+s/2.0)/(1+s/12.0) with K=6, yielding P.O.=34%, T_s=1.3 s, ω_B=8.4 rad/s, and P.M.=45.6°.",
